tei:div.tei:p:
//gnyis pa yo byad bsham bkod kyi rim pa ni/ zhi bar slob dpon gyi g.yon phyogs nas brtsams te g.yas bskor du rim pa bzhin chu bzhi/ nyer spyod lnga/ mar la bcos pa'i gtor ma dang bcas pa stegs bu mtho dman nam phyi nang byas pa'i khar 'das ma 'das kyi tshar gnyis bsham/ ma 'byor na tshar gcig spyi sor bshams la mchod 'bul re re bzhin mchod pa rnams brje ba'am kha gso/ yang g.yas phyogs kyi mdun ngos nas brtsams te snga ma bzhin du zhi bar yam shing byang chub kyi shing sogs 'o ma can lnga bshad kyang bod du mi 'byor bas ba lu sogs 'o ma can du btags pa'i rtse mo'i cha las byung ba slob dpon gyi mthe'u chung gi tshad tsam sor bcu gnyis pa/ sbrang rtsi dang*/ 'o ma mar khu rnams kyis rtse mo sbags pa ji tsam 'os pa dang*/ ba'am ra'i mar gyi khu ba/ til nag yungs kar/ zho bag phye bu ram gsum mam/ 'o ma sbrang rtsi zhib bsres pa'i ril bu'i zas mchog dang*/ zho/ 'bras/ so ba/ nas/ sran ma/ gro/ dūrwa/ ku sha sngon po rtsa rtse ma nyams pa mar dang 'o mas sbags pa dang*/ shing tog sna tshogs rnams dang*/ bsnyen pa'i kha skong sogs dmigs bsal la phye gtsang mar gong gsal rdzas rnams ka ṭo ra chen por phyogs gcig tu bsres pa bung skyed de bsham mo//
slob dpon gyi mdun me yol gyi nang du g.yon nas rim bzhin me lha'i gdan gyi ku sha chun po bcu/ nang mchod rdo rje/ dgang blugs kha sbyar dril bu/ me tog bsang gtor gyi ku sha rlung g.yab rnams bsham/ gzhan yang las mthun gyi khrus ras dang gos zung dag kyang bsham mo// //gsum pa slob dpon gyi chas gos sogs bstan pa ni/ zhi bar gos dkar po bgo zhing rgyan yang shel lam mu tig rigs lnga thor tshugs cod pan bcas so//
slob dpon gyi kha lta phyogs ni/ zhi bar kha shar du blta bar sambu ṭi las gsungs shing*/ dkyil 'khor dang 'brel na thab dkyil 'khor gyi phyogs gang du bya ba'am de nyid las/
